00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:13.530
B-But why not!?

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:16.870
In the end, my three-year quest for adventure

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:18.540
led me to this land

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:20.530
and to this man.

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:24.710
I have selected Peter Grill...

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:27.540
The strongest warrior on the planet,
as the official "donor"!

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:34.840
Our destiny as a species is to strive 
for a generation more powerful than the last.

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:38.720
It is especially important 
given my future as the leader of Ogrestan.

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:42.370
Therefore, I am determined 
not to return to our motherland

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:44.810
