00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:53.660
I, Spartokos, have admired you 
since our tender youth!

00:08:53.660 --> 00:08:56.070
Day after day, I devoted myself 
to training in the art of combat

00:08:56.070 --> 00:08:58.640
so as to become a man worthy of your affection–

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.120
