Spartokos!

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:32.800
You speak the truth...

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:34.920
The Spartokos I left behind in our homeland

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:38.110
led a life of incompetence, 
unable to surpass your strength...

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:41.470
However, in order to become 
a man worthy of your affection,

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:44.690
I have devoted the past three years 
to an even more difficult training regimen,

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:48.120
and I stand before you 
having refined my combat prowess!

00:09:48.630 --> 00:09:53.130
Now is the time to demonstrate the fruits of my labor!

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:55.220
Peter Grill!

00:09:55.870 --> 00:09:56.470
Huh?

00:10:02.220 --> 00:10:04.970
For the honor of standing at Lady Lisa's side...

00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:08.020
I challenge you to a duel!

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:09.230
Wha...?

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:14.740
Apparently someone challenged 
that dude who won the Grand Fighting Tournament to a duel!

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:17.730
I heard this whole thing started because of a woman...

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:23.240
But, if memory serves, 
doesn't Peter Grill have a fiancée?

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:26.650
They say that the challenger 
has a personal stake in this duel...

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:31.750
I get it, "Defeat the strongest man alive,
become famous, and propose to the girl," right?

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:36.510
Which means Sir Peter agreed to this fight 
despite the fact that there's nothing in it for him...

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:38.780
<i>Fantastic...</i>

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:42.030
<i>Even if I win the match,
 it's not gonna change anything...</i>

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:43.510
<i>Wait a minute...!</i>

00:10:44.480 --> 00:10:46.260
<i>If I were to end up losing,</i>

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:49.560
<i>Spartokos-kun would take Lisa 
back home to their country...</i>

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:51.180
<i>Which would leave one less obstacle</i>

00:10:51.180 --> 00:10:53.520
<i>in the way of my relationship with Luvellia-senpai...</i>

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:56.020
<i>That's it...</i>

00:10:56.030 --> 00:11:00.030
All I gotta do is throw the match...!

00:11:00.570 --> 00:11:03.160
It started out as a simple crush

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:06.200
Suddenly, you were my biggest source of strength

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:08.830
Till death do us part, let's grow old together

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:12.080
This is my sincerest wish:

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:14.170
Stay with me, stay with me

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:17.840
So long time, by my side for all eternity

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:21.050
Beaten down by our daily struggles

00:11:21.050 --> 00:11:23.470
Or soaked by a storm of rage;

00:11:23.470 --> 00:11:26.430
If you get drenched, I won't hesitate

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:28.810
To be the umbrella that shields you

00:11:28.810 --> 00:11:31.520
It's not so cold... I'm by your side

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:33.980
That's good enough for me

00:11:33.980 --> 00:11:37.150
You're my rock, my strength

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:41.030
That smile of yours puts my soul at ease

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:43.450
I could search the whole world over

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:45.530
And find no one like you

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:48.540
You're my rock, my strength

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:52.500
Just the sight of you fills my heart with joy

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:54.710
No matter how much it may hurt,

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:57.750
I pledge my life to protecting you

00:12:00.420 --> 00:12:02.630
Dear Sir Peter Grill,

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:05.090
Since you're the world's strongest warrior,

00:12:05.090 --> 00:12:07.840
challengers are gonna start 
comin' outta the woodwork.

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:09.720
Episode      Peter Grill and Dueling Manners

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:09.720
